WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:05.520
1 Year Ago

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:07.880
That Eve bitch is making 
a huge mess in <i>our</i> territory!

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.980
She's ruining our business!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.630
Can we just let her get away with this?

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.610
Let her do what she wants.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.800
What's gotten into you?

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.360
We've always crushed anybody who opposed us!

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.120
In golf, and in fighting, too!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.260
It's not the right time yet.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:26.720
The right time?

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:31.080
She's only been an underground 
golfer for six months.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:34.780
I could challenge her to a 
game right now and crush her.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:37.230
But that wouldn't satisfy me.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.000
The fruit's not ripe yet.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.950
When she grows up and learns what golf is...

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:47.030
I'm going to challenge her.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:53.650
And then Eve will realize she 
can't beat my golfing. <i>Ever.</i>

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:57.150
Why is that Eve bitch so important to you?

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:00.080
Pride. And...

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:03.560
A little bit of sentimentality.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:08.030
Let her be for a while.

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:09.500
Understood?

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.740
Yes, ma'am.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:18.140
Looks like we were fated to fight.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:20.600
You're the one who set this all up.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:21.680
Yup.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:25.380
So I won't regret anything. I won't need to.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.130
Now, let's begin...

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:33.460
The ultimate golf, where both 
of our lives are on the line!

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:39.520
I didn't think <i>you'd</i> be our opponent!

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:44.120
I'd heard you hadn't been playing lately, 
so I thought you'd retired.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:47.070
I didn't need to.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:49.860
Eve was good enough to handle you.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.880
There was no point in me showing up.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:53.620
What?

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:56.760
I don't care if it's 
ultimate golf or regular golf.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.930
Either way, I'll pierce you through.

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:00.770
With my Rainbow Bullet...

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:04.170
I'm going to open a hole in your chest!

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:07.720
Well, well. Glad to hear it.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.470
The rules will be the same as last time.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.440
1 hole. Match play.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:50.000
In case of a tie, sudden death 
until we have a winner.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.590
The hole layouts will be chosen randomly.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.270
Will that do, madame?

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.330
Yes. Of course.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:04.540
Please ensure the layouts are random.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:08.800
Do not attempt to pick layouts 
that favor your player.

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:12.100
I understand.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.410
Excellent.

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.640
Now, let us begin...

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.600
Let's starting!

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:49.480
Par 4. 387 yards.

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:52.480
Wide fairway. Mostly flat terrain.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.120
An easy hole, huh?

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:55.940
We'll be trying for eagles, then.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:58.370
Yup.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.200
Heads.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.320
You've got honor.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.200
Give 'em hell.

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:12.960
You don't need to tell me.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:18.460
<i>I can't lose this match!</i>

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:23.970
<i>Klein, Lily... the kids' 
futures... their tomorrow...</i>

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:26.220
<i>I'll make </i>sure<i> they're safe.</i>

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:28.510
<i>Direct strike...</i>

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:31.680
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.450
<i>Nice.</i>

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.280
<i>If we lose, we're both dead.</i>

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.640
<i>She has such a strong mental game.</i>

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:53.270
That certainly flew quite a ways!

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:56.360
I bet it's over 250 yards.

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.660
Quite the big drive!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.000
Nice shot.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.010
Rose Aleon...

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:09.220
Eve, you ever see her play?

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:10.510
Nope.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:15.520
<i>When I met her, she'd already 
retired from betting golf.</i>

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:19.810
I saw her play, just once. Four years ago.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.060
What was she like?

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.430
Just like you.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:25.220
All about brute strength.

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:27.970
<i>Her tee is high up.</i>

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.200
Crimson...

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.920
Rose Bullet!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.880
How did she do that?

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:54.220
Impossible!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:57.320
14 yards ahead of Eve?

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:04.350
This is the power of the 
Crimson Lady, Rose Aleon,

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:06.840
who's defeated every 
challenger she's ever met!

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:11.540
T-That shot...

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:15.880
<i>Load the bullet.</i>

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.960
<i>Cock the hammer.</i>

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:19.850
<i>Aim.</i>

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.850
<i>Pull the trigger.</i>

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:24.050
<i>And fire it from the barrel!</i>

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.280
It can't be...

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:28.990
That's right.

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:30.930
It's just what you're thinking.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:34.810
You're not the only one 
who Leo taught how to play golf!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.140
Why didn't you tell me?

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.940
There was no reason to!

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:44.030
But if you had Leo teach you for three years

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:46.640
and you still can't shoot farther than that...

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:51.150
Eve, as a fellow student, 
I'm going to end your life right here.

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:53.650
I'll burn you to death...

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.160
With my crimson flames.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.660
<i>Purple (Aoi) Bullet</i>

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.160
<i>I can't believe Eve and Rose 
studied under the same teacher.</i>

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:06.370
<i>Having her get ahead of us 
with the driver was bad,</i>

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:11.070
<i>but the mental damage is worse.</i>

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.530
135 yards left.

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:15.040
Will the #8 do?

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.380
That one hit me hard.

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:18.310
It was a great punch to start the fight.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.390
Don't look so worried.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:22.970
I'm fine.

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:25.300
I'm really fired up right now!

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:32.990
<i>I thought that I could only 
ever play real golf with her...</i>

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:36.480
<i>But she's really started a fire in me.</i>

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.500
<i>A fire... that lit my fuse!</i>

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:44.750
<i>Combo strike... Blue Bullet!</i>

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.200
A birdie chance.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:59.090
What are you so happy 
about? It's still early.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:01.600
Rose has a chance for an eagle.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:03.480
Crimson...

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.370
Rose Bullet!

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:15.360
<i>No! It's on the line!</i>

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.000
Hey! Hey!

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.790
Hey hey hey!

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:24.080
Whew!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.360
It missed.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:29.190
That was close, huh?

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:31.470
I didn't think I'd miss that shot.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:34.550
I guess my mind's not 
out of retirement mode yet.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:38.060
But... I can still recover from this.

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:46.710
Both sides got birdies.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:48.890
Time for sudden death.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:52.600
<i>But in reality, Rose is winning.</i>

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.860
<i>We're losing the match.</i>

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:57.440
Changing the hole layout.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:14.490
Par 3, 158 yards.

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:18.140
<i>An island green, with lake all around!</i>

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:21.680
If you can't land it 
on the green, it's over!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.130
I can.

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:27.280
<i>She's got the initiative, sure.</i>

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:31.810
<i>But Rose's back is still in my firing range.</i>

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:35.790
<i>Heaven's... Red Bullet!</i>

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:42.540
Yes! Good shot!

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:47.020
N-No... that's impossible!

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.540
So close!

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:00.550
<i>I got another step closer.</i>

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:02.550
<i>I don't know about that.</i>

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:08.010
<i>I'll show you how much you're outmatched!</i>

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.660
No! Impossible!

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:29.880
Now go in the hole!

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:38.760
T-That's bad for my heart.

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:40.930
I don't want to waste time.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.640
We'll call a draw for this one, right?

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:43.510
Sure.

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:46.270
<i>Next hole, I'll incinerate you!</i>

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.010
<i>Next hole, I'll shoot you down!</i>

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:05.280
You couldn't see the sign on the door?

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.280
We're closed...

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:12.490
<i>That's the man who taught Eve golf.</i>

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:16.820
I took a plane to get here.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.760
You could least give me a drink.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.370
You're closing up for good, aren't you?

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:25.930
Why don't you sell me all 
the alcohol you've got left?

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:32.530
Eve's not here...

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.540
I'm not here for her.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:38.270
An old acquaintance called me.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:41.000
Can I ask you just one thing?

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.520
Why did you teach Eve golf?

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:47.280
A certain man asked me.

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:49.800
No, that's not right.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:52.040
Because I wanted to see...

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:54.520
See what?

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:57.790
I thought you were asking me just one thing.

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:01.020
Let me ask you one thing, too.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:04.300
Is Eve working for the mafia now?

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.300
That's one thing she's adamantly refused.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:12.480
Then there's no need to worry.

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:16.060
Just sit back and wait, 
and she'll come home safe.

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:06.730
Seven draws in a row...

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:09.240
How long can this keep going?

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:11.910
Changing hole layout.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.170
<i>Rose, you're having a bad time.</i>

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:22.680
<i>I'm glad I looked into 
the girl's play style, then.</i>

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:25.660
<i>All she can do is hit the ball straight.</i>

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:31.470
<i>So I just need to make 
a hole where she can't do that.</i>

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:33.960
T-This hole...

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.280
<i>That old hag cheated.</i>

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:48.520
<i>Yes, I certainly did.</i>

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:52.720
<i>Hole 8. Par 4. 470 yards.</i>

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:57.090
<i>If you can slice with the first swing, 
you can be on the green in two.</i>

00:14:57.090 --> 00:15:03.040
<i>But if you can only shoot straight, 
it will take you three shots at minimum.</i>

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.300
<i>She's finished now.</i>

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.710
Eve, the way you play golf, you can't...

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:09.970
I'll shoot through.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.300
Like I always do.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:17.810
<i>Now then, what will you do, Eve?</i>

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.060
<i>What will you do, Eve?</i>

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:26.490
<i>She can only do one thing: 
shoot straight ahead, right?</i>

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:30.260
<i>I've got seven colors of bullets.</i>

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.540
<i>Shine... Purple (Aoi)!</i>

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.100
<i>A slice...</i>

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.500
<i>...ball?</i>

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:50.010
<i>How can she do </i>that<i>?!</i>

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:58.250
W-When did you learn to slice?

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:00.160
In VR.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:01.480
What?

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.360
<i>A slice ball?</i>

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:08.800
<i>You made that incredible shot 
the first time we played, right?</i>

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>Teach me!</i>

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.840
<i>Sure, I guess...</i>

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:15.520
<i>Eve, you can't slice?</i>

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:16.520
<i>Is that bad?</i>

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:17.990
<i>No, it's not bad...</i>

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:20.240
<i>Then teach me already!</i>

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.600
<i>O-Okay...</i>

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:27.510
This is my new Rainbow Bullet!

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:29.960
The curved shot Purple Bullet!

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:32.010
Purple Bullet...

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:35.270
I've got the barrel 
of my gun against your back.

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.060
I can shoot it whenever I want.

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.010
You're joking.

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:43.200
<i>My flames can't be quenched that easily!</i>

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.710
<i>Let the fire rise!</i>

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:47.710
<i>Crimson Rose Bullet!</i>

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.730
I told you.

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:05.120
The barrel of my gun's against your back.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:08.880
Miss...

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:11.450
Shut up and carry my bag!

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:13.560
R-Right! Sorry!

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:20.190
<i>Rose's tee shot was less 
powerful than it had been.</i>

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:24.760
<i>Something happened 
the instant of the impact.</i>

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:26.770
<i>But what?</i>

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.040
<i>She's on the green.</i>

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:46.840
<i>But compared to hole 7, 
her shots aren't as accurate.</i>

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:48.900
Eve, this is your chance.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:51.120
I won't miss.

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:00.930
Go!

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:02.630
Go in!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.620
So close!

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:13.200
Can we just say she won?

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:18.120
<i>But for the first time, 
we have the initiative here.</i>

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.410
<i>The distance is about 4 meters.</i>

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.870
<i>And a two ball hook line.</i>

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:25.430
<i>This would be an easy putt normally,</i>

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:27.760
<i>but her life's on the line here.</i>

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:32.250
<i>That should be more than 
enough pressure on Rose.</i>

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:36.050
Well, this certainly is a thrilling match.

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:39.050
<i>Golf should always be like this.</i>

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.050
<i>She smiled!</i>

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:50.640
I've been through a lot 
more bad spots than you.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.720
Too bad.

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:54.990
Nice shot.

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:02.950
Hole 9. Par 5. 605 yards.

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:05.440
An extra-long hole.

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:08.170
And Rose isn't as powerful 
off the tee shot anymore.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:09.160
This is your shot!

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:15.360
<i>Sure, Rose is starting to slow down.</i>

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:21.640
<i>But the tension and pressure are starting 
to wear on Eve's concentration too.</i>

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:24.640
<i>Hang in there, Eve.</i>

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:31.880
<i>Klein, Lily, Emily, Charlotte, Jessica...</i>

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:34.640
<i>I won't ask you to lend me your strength.</i>

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:39.070
<i>But I'll put my wishes for you into this bullet!</i>

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:41.560
Bullet loaded!

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:47.200
Screaming... Blue Bullet!

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:57.800
T-That trajectory is unbelievable!

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.790
The ball's not dropping!

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:01.600
It's still not dropping...

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.600
It's still not dropping!

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:09.180
Drop, damn you!!

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:21.910
The distance was...

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:25.820
278 yards!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.030
The longest drive today!

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:34.360
N-No, that's impossible...

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:37.370
Wake up, Madame!

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:44.260
This time, I'll pierce 
through from the front!

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:47.040
Just try it.

00:22:20.140 --> 00:22:21.660
<i>I won't lose...</i>

00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:24.880
<i>I'll finish things here, on Hole 9!</i>

00:22:26.520 --> 00:22:27.490
<i>Miss...</i>

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:32.160
Rose, this is the last time I'll teach you.

00:22:32.800 --> 00:22:34.450
<i>Shut up.</i>

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:36.750
You're a fool of a woman.

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.280
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:22:39.490 --> 00:22:42.750
<i>I'll show you a shot 
that nobody else can match!</i>

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:44.720
<i>Take this!</i>

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:46.600
<i>Crimson...</i>

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:51.810
<i>Rose Bullet!</i>

00:23:14.730 --> 00:23:15.950
They're even!

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:17.560
Impossible...

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:50.050
Next Episode

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:44.400
Eve, thank you so much for fighting for us!

00:23:44.670 --> 00:23:45.600
I'm sad!

00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:48.560
And I'm more sad I don't 
get any screen time!
